  "notes": [
    "Complete list: 5 actions, returned by getActions() (analogway-pls300.js:141-263) and registered in init; no feedbacks (init calls setFeedbackDefinitions({}) at line 20) and no variables.",
    "Protocol: Analog Way text protocol, over TCP or UDP selectable by the config dropdown 'prot' (default 'tcp'), both to port 10500 (hard-coded, lines 92 and 119). Each command is sent twice, separated by CR LF, and has no trailing line terminator (for example `1,<layer>,<input>IN`).",
    "All dropdown ids are strings. The input list is the same one the freeze action iterates over (ids 0-6, 9-12; no 7 or 8).",
    "The layer dropdown only offers layer 2 ('BG Live') and layer 3 ('PiP 1 (BG Live 2 in Matrix)'); Background Frame always targets layer 0 (command '1,0,<frame>IN').",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ~1.4.0: options do not support expressions. Presets (getPresets, lines 288-464) are not catalogued."
  ]
